        }
      ],
      "impact": "Both UART-to-SPI/I2C bridges are forced into I2C mode while the board is wired for SPI. The serial expansion paths driven by SERIAL_COPI/CIPO/CLK and CS1/CS2 will not communicate correctly, making the associated serial interfaces nonfunctional.",
